    {
      "task_id": "HO-CRITIC",
      "target_agent": "reporter_critic",
      "objective": "Using up to 2 tool calls, independently verify flow_tracer's flow-conservation results and calculations for the prioritized subgraphs, run sanity checks on amounts/timestamps to detect duplication or rounding errors, and produce a short critique highlighting any data gaps or uncertainties that must be resolved before escalation; confirm final recommendation readiness.",
