      "allowed_tool_budget": 5
    },
    {
      "task_id": "HO-REG",
      "target_agent": "regulatory_analyst",
      "objective": "Map regulatory obligations and thresholds relevant to ALT-V2-D0044. Actions: (a) search_regulations for local Indian AML/CTR thresholds and guidance on scatter/gather typologies; (b) get_clause_by_id for any specific clauses cited by policy (reporting thresholds, suspicious activity definitions, preservation/retention requirements). Deliverables: concise list of applicable laws/clauses, reporting triggers tied to INR 11,359,312.54, and suggested regulatory actions (file SAR/Suspicious Transaction Report or internal escalation). Keep within tool-call budget 2.",
