      "target_agent": "reporter_critic",
      "objective": "Perform QA and finalize investigative findings. Actions: (a) run compute_flow_conservation independently on final graphs to validate flow_tracer metrics; (b) perform critical analysis of the assembled narrative, flag inconsistencies, missing evidence, or overclaims; (c) produce the final investigator-ready report (finish) that includes an executive summary, evidence appendix (transactions/graphs/KYC highlights), recommended disposition, and clear next steps for casework/escalation. Deliverables: QA notes and final report. Keep within tool-call budget 2.",
